        "sid": "REV 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimwekeshu chaYesu Kristu chamumwekesheluwu kudi Nzambi, kulonda aleji ambuŋindi yuma yikukeŋa kumwekana mumafuku akadi kuvula. Watemesheli kaŋelu kindi nakuyishimuna kudi kambuŋindi Yowanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowu washimwini wunsahu wamazu aNzambi nimwashimwiniyi Yesu Kristu, yoyuma yamweniyi yejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowu wukutaŋila akwawu nako-oleki, ninawa akutiya mazu awuprofwetu iwu anakooleki, akuhemba yuma yanasonekuwu mwenimu; muloŋa mpinji keŋa yishiki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami Yowanu nasonekeli yipompelu yekala muAsiya yitanu nayiyedi. Luwi lwikali nanenu nikuwunda kwakufuma kudi owu wekala kwoku, wadiŋi kwoku, wamba kenza; kwakufuma nikudi aspiritu ekala kumesu etanda dindi dawanta atanu nayedi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwakufuma nikudi Yesu Kristu, yowu chinsahu washinshika, yowu wedi wamudi afu, yowu nyuli yawanyanta aheseki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena watukeŋa watuwelesheli nyiloŋa yetu namashi indi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watwilishili twi kali wanta, atupristu twaNzambi yindi, yowu Tata. Kulema niwanta wikali windi haya nyaka nanyaka. Amena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Talenu, hakwinza namavu, antu ejima akamumona namesu, niwena amupwikili; ninyuza yejima yaheseki yakamudila makumbu. Mwamweni. Amena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova Nzambi wekala kwoku, wadiŋi kwoku, wamba kenza, Watwesha yejima nindi, Ami yami Alefwa, yami Omega.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami mana kwenu Yowanu, mukwakumwena hamu nenu ihuŋu niwanta nikutatakena kwamudi Yesu, nadiŋi hachitutu, ijina dachu Patamosa, kukoola mazu aNzambi, nikushimuna nsaŋu yaYesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nadiŋi mudi Spiritu hefuku daMwanta; hinukutiya kunyima izu davuma neyi mpùŋa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Ami yami Alefwa, yami Omega, yami Tachi, yami Nkumininaku. Yiwukumona yisoneki mumukanda, wutemeshi kuyipompelu yitanu nayiyedi yekala kuEfwesesa, nikuSimirina, nikuPeriŋamu, nikuTiyatira, nikuSaradisa, nikuFwiladelifwiya, nikuLayodikeya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukubalumuka nami nitali izu dinahoshi nanami. Chinabalumuki nimona nimanoŋu awuru atanu nayedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukachi kamanoŋu mudi wudi neyi Mwana kamuntu, navwali ihina dakuluka nikunyendu, kwibwambu kudi mukwatu wawuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutu windi ninsuki jindi jitooka to-o neyi wanda wutooka, chikwanvula yamalola; nimesu indi adi neyi muzuzu wakesi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ninyendu yindi yidi neyi wuneŋu wakekema, wakoseka dehi muluteŋu; niizu dindi didi neyi kuvuma kwameji amavulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchikasa chindi chachidiilu mudi tutumbwa tutanu natuyedi; mukanwa kindi mwedika mpoku yakabali yatwa, yikweti wumwemu kuyedi; kumesu indi kudi neyi chatoŋekaŋa itaŋwa naŋovu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinamumweni hinukudimbukila kunyendu yindi neyi nimufu hohu. Hakunnaŋika chikasa chindi chachidiilu nindi, Bayi wutiya womaku, yami Tachi, yami Nkumininaku, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yami Mumi; kufwa nafwili, hakwinzichi nahanda haya nyaka nanyaka. Nsapi jakufwa nŋakaluŋa jidi nanami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi sonekaku yuma yiwunamoni, niniyi yiduku, niyuma yamba kenza kukukuminina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nsaŋu yakujinda yatutumbwa tutanu natuyedi tuwunamoni muchikasa chami chachidiilu, niamanoŋu awuru atanu nayedi; tutumbwa tutanu natuyedi hiyaŋelu ayipompelu yitanu nayiyedi; nimanoŋu, atanu nayedi hiyipompelu yitanu nayiyedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
